{
  "name": "dsh-panda-calendar",
  "description": "Global Chinese calendar & weather for DeepSeek Harness Web: a '熊猫日历' conversation-view tab (next to 对话/轨迹) with solar/lunar dates, ganzhi/zodiac, solar terms, traditional & international festivals, China public holidays (incl. 调休 workdays), multi-city weather, an epoch↔date converter with time-zone selection, and on-this-day history (大事记 + 名人诞辰) — free data sources, no API key. 熊猫日历：会话页头新增「熊猫日历」标签页，公历/农历/干支/生肖/节气、中国传统与国际通用节日、中国法定节假日（含调休）、多城市天气、时间戳转换（秒/毫秒 ↔ 年月日时分秒，可选时区、自动处理夏令时）、历史上的今天（大事记 + 名人诞辰）；全部数据源免费、无需 API Key。",
  "version": "1.2.3",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/runcat-tommy/dsh-panda-calendar.git"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "calendar",
    "lunar",
    "lunar-calendar",
    "chinese-calendar",
    "holiday",
    "weather",
    "timestamp",
    "epoch",
    "timezone",
    "农历",
    "日历",
    "节假日",
    "天气",
    "时间戳",
    "时区"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    },
    "marketplace": {
      "profiles": ["web"],
      "requiresBuildApproval": false,
      "requiresRestart": true,
      "manualSteps": false
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "lib",
    "LICENSE",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "CHANGELOG.en.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test \"test/*.test.mjs\""
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "opencc-js": "^1.4.2"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
